On 2026-10-01 CHG-0039 produced an 89.50-second Playwright site demo at [`deliverables/ramsider-uno-demo.mp4`](deliverables/ramsider-uno-demo.mp4). It shows top-to-bottom scroll, 40/40 distinct planned controls, RU then EN copy, final back-to-top, an original English arena-style synthetic narration, crowd mix, and selectable English captions. Browser action audit and full MP4 decode pass; Pro Max shows no overflow. This is a recording of the current site, not user approval of CHG-0036. CHG-0039 remains `APPLIED_UNVERIFIED`: model-side audio audition is unavailable and native review was rejected by automatic approval review because `--uncommitted` could send the whole repository diff externally. See [script and evidence](docs/demo-video-script.md) and [journal](CHANGELOG.md#chg-0039).

## Open dependencies

The render does not supply confirmed prices, certificates/files, film media, FAQ answers, account/configurator/checkout services, or final action destinations. Local controls open explanatory modal dialogs instead of fabricated checkout or documents. All translated copy and product claims need product approval before publication. See [PRODUCT.md](PRODUCT.md) for specific claims and flows.

## Update rule

Update this file when a **verified** project state, durable decision, or external dependency changes, including during long work before context is lost. Replace stale entries instead of appending a running diary. Date material changes and link to the code, command, screenshot, or document that supports them. Check volatile claims against the current files; current user instructions and evidence win over stale memory. Label assumptions and unverified facts explicitly; keep secrets, private data, generated logs, and temporary task notes out. When a repeatable error or user correction yields a prevention rule, update [LESSONS.md](LESSONS.md) instead. Reconcile any affected topic document so the sources do not contradict each other.
